  "description": "The power of women playing soccer. \n\nEo-Nam is unexpectedly invited to join the local women's soccer team. With bad group experiences in the past, she isn't sure if soccer is for her. But after that first kick of the ball and getting to know the other women on the team, Eo-Nam's life begins to change for the better. \n\n(Source: Manta, edited)",
